 cognitive trade-offs involved. The research, based on a survey of 319 prof=
essionals, reveals a nuanced transformation: while AI can reduce the mental=
 effort required for many tasks, it may also lead to diminished critical en=
gagement in certain contexts.</p><div style=3D"min-height: 90px;"><div clas=
