-1"></div></fbs-ad></div></div><ul><li>AI-generated content is copied and u=
sed without verification.</li><li>Workers rely on AI for decision-making wi=
thout questioning its logic.</li><li>Users assume AI-generated responses ar=
e accurate without contextual understanding.</li><li>Tasks become routine, =
leading to reduced engagement in problem-solving and independent thought.</=
li></ul><a class=3D"embed-base color-body color-body-border link-embed embe=
